{"skill":{"slug":"google-tasks-api","displayName":"Google Tasks"},"version":{"version":"1.2.5","createdAt":1790938058961,"changelog":"Simplify the login instructions to the code flow (maton login prints a link; finish with maton login --code <CODE>), drop the API Key subsection, and pin the Maton CLI install to 0.4.0.","changelogSource":"user","license":"MIT-0","files":[{"path":"SKILL.md","size":55733,"sha256":"e4bf5284812bba652d510e92211597700416363c1d5c4d0e52e7b40a75ee8ac8","contentType":"text/markdown"},{"path":"references/calendly/triggers.md","size":10281,"sha256":"ae92dbfb6dd4caf628900b293d1b3c6e7d5e70cf7f6a9397407594daf50d4a48","contentType":"text/markdown"},{"path":"references/github/triggers.md","size":61142,"sha256":"7424d3be38ec400eb8a4b0a6a94a94eeec40208c0bcee29a61caa5da48eea7f4","contentType":"text/markdown"},{"path":"references/google-mail/triggers.md","size":2648,"sha256":"5cc5065cd7db33dc33715675bbb0ee29ed49657ad9ad4354aebd1a9efdf8d8f3","contentType":"text/markdown"},{"path":"references/hubspot/triggers.md","size":8298,"sha256":"439d56e4d02e119e1de3caf79a0334243ae70c583a3e15847831c396f39c2837","contentType":"text/markdown"},{"path":"references/linear/triggers.md","size":7270,"sha256":"641f6496f50e09faab921ef4c06f725122b798cb034e9f0dfaf9f838074ab377","contentType":"text/markdown"},{"path":"references/notion/triggers.md","size":5840,"sha256":"fdaf3840d8213dbd7549426c1166f94cc94b09e022a1611ef2dad6f36db2f969","contentType":"text/markdown"},{"path":"references/slack/triggers.md","size":6181,"sha256":"b5ee099a215223a7e5186c41a0d13fc1de68e977719304c509df105843d81f38","contentType":"text/markdown"},{"path":"references/stripe/triggers.md","size":25651,"sha256":"ae091545396a376c7ecfe09e94b46b7bbb44fd8a72ea954bcc1239052b7959f0","contentType":"text/markdown"},{"path":"references/time/triggers.md","size":1140,"sha256":"b8f5a523501f8d03e11e58f6426cd96b54ba0c66c8983b57c0ea31386b309e01","contentType":"text/markdown"},{"path":"skill-card.md","size":2344,"sha256":"dd6f04c5489e3fbd0998bb18060cf2b64c791a58e610974e77dc407afad7f4da","contentType":"text/markdown"}],"security":{"status":"clean","hasWarnings":true,"checkedAt":1790942464725,"model":null,"hasScanResult":true,"sha256hash":"7c502128a6c6d4611af11ceba3d5242527797c14f3c831c222bd06fc704045d6","virustotalUrl":"https://www.virustotal.com/gui/file/7c502128a6c6d4611af11ceba3d5242527797c14f3c831c222bd06fc704045d6","scanners":{"vt":{"status":"clean","verdict":null,"normalizedStatus":"clean","analysis":null,"source":"engines","checkedAt":1790942207587},"skillspector":{"status":"clean","normalizedStatus":"clean","score":0,"severity":"LOW","recommendation":"CAUTION","issueCount":0,"checkedAt":1790942464725},"llm":{"status":"clean","verdict":"benign","normalizedStatus":"clean","confidence":"high","summary":"This skill is a disclosed Google Tasks integration that uses Maton authentication and clearly asks for user approval before writes, new connections, hosted functions, or persistent automations.","dimensions":[{"detail":"Bash, Read, Grep, and Glob are proportionate for installing and using a CLI-backed API integration; raw HTTP with MATON_API_KEY is documented only as a fallback when the CLI cannot be used and includes handling cautions.","label":"Credentials","name":"environment_proportionality","rating":"ok"},{"detail":"Installation uses pinned Maton CLI/package versions via npm or Homebrew, with no embedded executable scripts in the artifact package itself.","label":"Install Mechanism","name":"install_mechanism","rating":"note"},{"detail":"The skill includes broad Maton functions, triggers, and event-catalogue references for other sources, but repeatedly frames them as optional automation support that requires user request and approval and does not expand Google Tasks access by default.","label":"Instruction Scope","name":"instruction_scope","rating":"note"},{"detail":"OAuth credentials, hosted functions, triggers, and trigger destinations can persist beyond a single run, but the artifact discloses this, requires explicit approval, recommends DENY_ALL network policy for functions, and warns about persistent data forwarding.","label":"Persistence & Privilege","name":"persistence_privilege","rating":"note"},{"detail":"The artifact's stated purpose is Google Tasks CRUD access through Maton, and the documented task list/task operations match that purpose.","label":"Purpose & Capability","name":"purpose_capability","rating":"ok"}],"guidance":"Install only if you intend to connect Google Tasks through Maton. Confirm the target Google account and connection before writes, avoid API-key mode unless necessary, and be careful with hosted functions or trigger destinations because they can run or forward data persistently until removed.","findings":"[SkillSpector] expected: SkillSpector reported no issues; artifact review likewise found no hidden prompt override, exfiltration, destructive behavior, or purpose-mismatched instructions.\n[AIG SARIF] expected: The static scan reported no results. The sensitive behaviors observed, such as OAuth, CRUD operations, functions, triggers, and destinations, are disclosed integration capabilities with user-approval guardrails.","agenticRiskFindings":null,"riskSummary":null,"model":null,"checkedAt":1790942464725}}}}}